<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">This press release does
not constitute an offer to sell or a solicitation of offers to buy any securities of&nbsp;Aptorum Group.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">This press release includes
statements concerning&nbsp;Aptorum Group Limited&nbsp;and its future expectations, plans and prospects that constitute &ldquo;forward-looking
